    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this world, you face countless opponents and must upgrade your inventory during each shopping phase to keep up with them.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four different types of themes, each played in a unique way. However, they all encourage you to play as many cards as possible. The power of animals helps you upgrade your equipment or generate long-term income.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, there are various characters, each with unique abilities to make your life easier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leaderboard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way to the top of the leaderboard and make a name for yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different items, each with unique attributes. Combine them wisely in your inventory to achieve the best synergy.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this world, you face countless opponents and must upgrade your inventory during each shopping phase to keep up with them.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four different types of themes, each played in a unique way. However, they all encourage you to play as many cards as possible. The power of animals helps you upgrade your equipment or generate long-term income.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, there are various characters, each with unique abilities to make your life easier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leaderboard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way to the top of the leaderboard and make a name for yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many different items, each with unique attributes. Combine them wisely in your inventory to achieve the best synergy.</p>",
    "short_description": "Qurtys is an inventory-strategy autobattler! You must play as many cards as possible in a single round to upgrade your equipment using the power of your Spirit Animals and withstand your opponents through countless rounds.",
